\">Video</span> | <a href=\"https://www.maine.gov/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/ARP%20EANS%20II%20Procurement%20Office%20Hour%2012-20-2022%20%281%29.pdf\">PDF</a></td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<div id=\"contact\" class=\"contact-cube\">\r\n<h3>Contact</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Kevin Harrington</strong><br />\r\n<em>EANS/GEER Coordinator</em><br />\r\n<strong>Email:</strong> <a href=\"mailto:Kevin.Harrington@maine.gov\">Kevin.Harrington@maine.gov</a></p>\r\n</div>\r\n\n<p class=\"doe-jump\"><a href=\"#contact\">Contact</a></p>\n<p class=\"doe-top\"><a href=\"#top\">Back to top</a></p>","notes":["1 section header — too few for a contents list."],"decisions":[{"id":"filechip","on":true,"label":"Tag a document link with the format it opens","why":"6 links on this page open a file — 6 Video — and say nothing about it, while others in the same list carry a tag because their author typed one. The format is read from the file name, so the list stops being half-labelled. No link text changes.","value":"6 links"},{"id":"tightcols","on":true,"label":"Let a column of short entries keep them on one line","why":"2 columns hold nothing longer than sixteen characters and sit in a table that also has a column of paragraphs. The layout sizes a column by its longest unbreakable run, so \"Step 1\" asks only for the width of \"Step\" and the paragraph column takes the rest — which is how \"Step\" and \"1\" end up on separate lines in a column with room to spare beside it. Held on one line, the column asks for what it needs. Nothing is widened by force and no word changes.","value":"2 columns in 1 table"},{"id":"searchtable","on":true,"label":"Let a long table be searched","why":"1 table runs to fifteen rows or more, so finding one row means reading every row. The theme already loads the search behaviour on every page and switches it on for any table marked this way — 26 tables across the site already are, including the contact directory. It adds a search box, a length menu and a pager, and makes the column headings sortable; ten rows show at a time, which is the library's own default. 1 of them open on the most recent row, because the first column is a date that sorts — the rest are left in the order they were written.","value":"1 table, 1 by date"},{"id":"eyebrow","on":true,"label":"Eyebrow: \"Federal Emergency Relief Programs\"","why":"Taken from the parent page, /fedrelief."}],"mechanical":["white-on-white text: 4","target set by destination: 6","loose text wrapped in a paragraph: 64","paragraph inside a table cell unwrapped: 64","row colours handed back to the striping rule: 36","redundant bold inside a heading removed: 1","file sizes removed: 16","action links marked: 8"],"findings":[],"safe":true,"audit":{"alias":"/fedrelief/eans","title":"Emergency Assistance for Non-Public Schools (EANS)","changed":"2026-04-07T17:11:27+00:00","words":204,"bytes":6523,"fixes":["white-on-white text: 4","loose text wrapped in a paragraph: 64","paragraph inside a table cell unwrapped: 64","row colours handed back to the striping rule: 36","redundant bold inside a heading removed: 1","file sizes removed: 16","action links marked: 8"],"flags":[],"contentSafe":true,"headings":[{"l":2,"t":"General Information","bh":true},{"l":3,"t":"Contact","bh":false}],"outline":[],"components":{"cards":0,"cardHeaders":0,"cardTitles":0,"accordions":0,"tables":1,"dataTables":1,"contactCube":1,"jumbotron":0,"dcNote":0,"blockheads":1,"videos":0,"images":0,"buttons":0},"access":{"imagesNoAlt":0,"vagueLinkText":[],"emptyLinks":0,"tablesNoScope":1,"multipleH1":0,"inlineColour":36},"links":{"internal":[],"files":["http://www.maine.gov/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/EANS%20Allocations.pdf","http://www.maine.gov/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Final-EANS-FAQ-2.0-3.19.21_1.pdf","http://www.maine.gov/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Copy%20of%20EANS%20Staffing%20Request.xlsx","http://www.maine.gov/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files